# CI before push / merge

- Before declaring a push or merge finished, verify the relevant CI (GitHub Actions / Engineering gates).
- Successful `git push` is not enough — wait for (or check) the workflow conclusion.
- If CI is red, fix the failing gate and push again; do not leave a broken main/PR as "done".
- Prefer running the cheap local equivalent of the failing job first when diagnosing (`npm test`, targeted vitest, etc.).
